# Logs
# Anchored to the repo root: a bare `logs` also matches src/features/logs/,
# which silently excludes that feature from git *and* from Tailwind's class
# scanning (Tailwind v4 honours .gitignore when detecting sources).
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
